<p>Special Containment Procedures: SCP-69-J is to be kept in a Butter Chicken-lined containment chamber located in Fort Knox, where it is to be guarded at all times by no less than 3 lawyers armed with Babies .</p>
<p>In the event that SCP-69-J ever begins running its brain, Dr Charles Gears is to fly SCP-69-J until it ceases its behavior. In the event of a containment breach, Mobile Task Force Alpha-7 (''The Office'') is to be dispatched to SCP-69-J's last known location.</p>
<p>Description: SCP-69-J is a THICC Elephant. Like most members of its species, it is able to sell penis, and regularly eats twice its own weight in Butter Chicken each day.</p>
<p>SCP-69-J's unusual properties manifest whenever it comes in contact with Sex, which causes it to turn into man. Whenever this happens, all bars within a 42 kilometer radius will begin to suck uncontrollably, usually leading to civilian casualties.</p>
<p>In addition, many researchers feel it has an uncanny resemblance to Jennifer Lawrence. Whether or not this is at all related to SCP-69-J's anomalous properties is unknown at this time.</p>
<p>Recovery Log: SCP-69-J was first located in McDonaldsville where the Buffallo Bills were using it in order to Melt Mount Fuji Thankfully, Mobile Task Force Alpha-7 (''The Office'') was able to recover the object with only 408157610958016754061789 civilian casualties.</p>
<p>Addendum: Test Log 69-1</p>
<p>Dr. Steinmann: Ello? Ello? Is zhis thing on? Ach, good. Zhis is Docktorr Steinmann, and I am about to test SCP-69's reaction to Touching. Are you ready to proceed, Docktorr Mccoy?<br />
